diagram fanInBarrier "Fan-in barrier: three independent release reviews"
viewport 202x72
theme midnight
direction right

text subtitle "Correctness, security, and visual reviewers inspect the same candidate concurrently; release waits for all verdicts" at 34,2 kind dim

node candidate "CANDIDATE\n\nfeature patch\ntests • screenshots\nacceptance criteria" at 1,26 size 19x10 kind input
node split "Evaluate" at 25,28 size 12x5 kind fork

group reviewers "parallel review nodes · isolated perspectives" at 42,5 size 91x55 kind parallel

group correctnessLane "correctness contract" at 44,7 size 86x15 kind lane in reviewers
node correctness "Correctness agent\nhigh-tier review" at 47,11 size 20x7 kind reviewer in correctnessLane
node correctnessChecks "CHECKS\nrequirements • invariants\nedge cases • regression" at 71,11 size 27x7 kind activity in correctnessLane
node correctnessReport "VERDICT\nPASS or defects\ntest evidence" at 101,11 size 24x7 kind output in correctnessLane

group securityLane "security contract" at 44,23 size 86x15 kind lane in reviewers
node security "Security agent\nhigh-tier review" at 47,27 size 20x7 kind reviewer in securityLane
node securityChecks "CHECKS\nauth • secrets • input\ndeps • threat paths" at 71,27 size 25x7 kind activity in securityLane
node securityReport "VERDICT\nPASS or findings\nattack narrative" at 101,27 size 24x7 kind output in securityLane

group visualLane "visual / UX contract" at 44,39 size 86x15 kind lane in reviewers
node visual "Visual agent\nheadless browser" at 47,43 size 20x7 kind reviewer in visualLane
node visualChecks "CHECKS\nscreenshots • responsive\na11y • baseline diff" at 71,43 size 27x7 kind activity in visualLane
node visualReport "VERDICT\nPASS or defects\nimage evidence" at 101,43 size 24x7 kind output in visualLane

node barrier "BARRIER\nwait for 3/3\nmerge findings" at 138,26 size 18x9 kind join
decision release "Release?" at 162,27 size 15x7
node publish "PUBLISH\nrelease bundle\n+ evidence" at 184,26 size 17x9 kind success
node repair "Repair worker\nassign owners\nresolve findings\nattach evidence" at 159,43 size 22x9 kind failure

edge fan candidate -> split from_port east to_port west
edge review_correctness split -> correctness from_port north to_port west via 31,14
edge review_security split -> security from_port east to_port west via 40,30
edge review_visual split -> visual from_port south to_port west via 31,46
edge correctness_run correctness -> correctnessChecks from_port east to_port west
edge correctness_emit correctnessChecks -> correctnessReport from_port east to_port west
edge security_run security -> securityChecks from_port east to_port west
edge security_emit securityChecks -> securityReport from_port east to_port west
edge visual_run visual -> visualChecks from_port east to_port west
edge visual_emit visualChecks -> visualReport from_port east to_port west
edge correctness_join correctnessReport -> barrier from_port east to_port north via 147,14
edge security_join securityReport -> barrier from_port east to_port west
edge visual_join visualReport -> barrier from_port east to_port south via 147,46
edge decide barrier -> release from_port east to_port west
edge approved release -> publish kind success label "3/3 PASS" from_port east to_port west
edge rejected release -> repair kind failure label "ANY FAIL" from_port south to_port north
edge recheck repair -> split kind back label "targeted rerun" from_port west to_port south via 156,47 156,58 31,58 31,33

